    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"new strength\" or \"new joy\" for a dancer who can't dance. that was my entire soul. everything else feels like a consolation prize that i never asked for. it's like being forced to live in a house that's been gutted by fire. why is the expectation always to just... keep existing in the ruins? it feels more like a burden than a life.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
